Investment items are items in DonutSMP kept long-term to gain a profit, similar to the real-life stock market. Notable items include:
{{Header|Heading=Elytra
|Body=The most valuable item currently in DonutSMP and are also one of the rarest items. They are so expensive (250m-320m) because they can be used to cover large distances quickly, allowing the user to locate massive stashes containing valuable items like netherite, spawners and possibly other elytras. Additionally, elytras have increased in value by over 3000x since the past year, making them the most profitable money making source.|}}

{{Space}}

{{Header|Heading=Dragon Heads
|Body=The only item in DonutSMP that may be rarer than the elytra. It has a purely ornamental purpose and is stackable, making it one of the best items for long-term investements. They sell about 10x cheaper then the elytra, being 40-50m each.|}}

{{Space}}

{{Header|Heading=Piglin Heads
|Body=They are like dragon heads, but not finite. However, since they are so hard to obtain, they cost 2-4m each. They are also stackable.

They are one of the best items to farm, as with a mob head farm that supports piglin use (with complicated nether systems), you can farm thousands. The only limitation they have is the fact that there aren't huge orders for them like there are for bones.
|}}

{{Space}}

{{Header|Heading=Netherite
|Body=[[File:Netherite being found.png|thumb|Netherite being found by a player]]
Netherite is currently was recently at its all-time high, being up to 10m for a single ingot. This is because it is finite, extremely useful for PVP and one of the most hoarded items on the entire server, resulting in its high price. However, it is still possible to find. This also includes Blocks of Netherite.
|}}

{{Space}}

{{Header|Heading=Enchanted Golden Apples
|Body=They are an extremely rare item that is almost always ornamental as it is way too valuable to consume.
|}}

{{Space}}

{{Header|Heading=Gear
|Body=These include diamond or netherite armour pieces or tools all enchanted with max enchants. The value of these items will increase over time and they are extremely useful in duels.
|}}

{{Space}}

{{Header|Heading=Sponges
|Body=Valuable as they are finite.
|}}

{{Space}}

{{Header|Heading=Gilded Blackstone
|Body=Gilded blackstone can cost from 1.4-3m per block,  this is because they are a finite resource. They are only used for decoration, usually in stashes. They are also stackable.

Note: Recently gilded has dropped ALOT (around 1M a block). It will also drop loads once the border expands (expected in a few months)
|}}
